{"id":"003dd9cf1547f943","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-name-hierarchy.md","title":"Name Hierarchy","display":"df-name-hierarchy — Name Hierarchy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-name-hierarchy","aliases":["58-df-name-hierarchy"],"display":"df-name-hierarchy — Name Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-name.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-name-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-name-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-name-hierarchy — Name Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot x,\\mathbb P,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(\\dot x,\\mathbb P,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span> (parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}\\)</span> (forcing-name predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NameRank}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{NameRank}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (rank graph defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rank}_{\\mathbb P}\">\\(\\operatorname{rank}_{\\mathbb P}\\)</span> (compatible partial-function notation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}name\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NameRank}_S(\\dot x,\\mathbb P,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\alpha=\\sup\\{\\operatorname{rank}_{\\mathbb P}(\\dot y)+1\\mid\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb P\\;(\\langle\\dot y,p\\rangle\\in\\dot x)\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}name\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NameRank}_S(\\dot x,\\mathbb P,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\alpha=\\sup\\{\\operatorname{rank}_{\\mathbb P}(\\dot y)+1\\mid\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb P\\;(\\langle\\dot y,p\\rangle\\in\\dot x)\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}name\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{rank}_{\\mathbb P}(\\dot x)=\\alpha\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NameRank}_S(\\dot x,\\mathbb P,\\alpha)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}name\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{rank}_{\\mathbb P}(\\dot x)=\\alpha\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NameRank}_S(\\dot x,\\mathbb P,\\alpha)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Names have rank according to their complexity.</li>\n<li>This parallels the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\alpha\">\\(V_\\alpha\\)</span> hierarchy.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-name.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Name}$ (forcing-name predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-name.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\dot x,\\mathbb P,\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Name}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NameRank}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rank}_{\\mathbb P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}name\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NameRank}_S(\\dot x,\\mathbb P,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\alpha=\\sup\\{\\operatorname{rank}_{\\mathbb P}(\\dot y)+1\\mid\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb P\\;(\\langle\\dot y,p\\rangle\\in\\dot x)\\}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}name\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{rank}_{\\mathb